00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:51.060
I acknowledge that the original website was kind of...

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:53.980
Had a lot of cobwebs on it and was in Squarespace.

00:01:54.660 --> 00:02:01.300
I said, you know, I dared to do something no one's ever done before and vibe code a website.

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:02.920
I'm the first.

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:04.200
I'm championing that.

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:12.880
