00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:43.160
And one strategy that I kind of latched onto early was just putting all of my points into one specific type of punch.

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:54.400
And then just using that specific type of punch to really bully, uh, the, the, the opponent into a position where they're just going to get, maybe that wasn't the best strategy, but it consistently worked for me.

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:59.040
I'm just like, I'm going to throw it all into straights and I'm just going to throw straights and I'm going to make sure those straights connect.

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:06.520
And it worked for a while until I, I did lose my first match when I was, uh, fighting the first ranking one, uh, opponent.

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:07.460
And I was like, oh, okay.

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:11.500
