00:21:23.480 --> 00:21:29.840
You know, there's some modification with like the, the direction that you're pressing with the blocks though, too, I think.

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:32.840
If there is, I didn't notice it.

00:21:33.360 --> 00:21:48.000
Yeah. I guess I didn't, I didn't notice that like, oh, um, if I, if I press up and B, but I guess maybe I was also just thinking like, I was thinking of it more like a timing thing where it's like, as long as you press the B button, just like, as long as you press the A button, you don't have to press any of the directions.

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:51.300
If you press the A button, it will throw a kind of punch.

00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:53.680
Yes. You know?

00:21:53.880 --> 00:22:00.820
So it's like, maybe I just wasn't experimenting enough with it, but I was thinking of the B button as like a timing thing of like, they throw a punch.

00:22:00.840 --> 00:22:03.220
You have to, you're not just like holding down the B button.

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:05.560
You're pressing the B button to block their punch.

